{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07870","headline":"登万岁楼 · 孟浩然","name":"登万岁楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万岁楼头望故乡，独令乡思更茫茫。\n天寒雁度堪垂泪，日落猿啼欲断肠。\n曲引古堤临冻浦，斜分远岸近枯杨。\n今朝偶见同袍友，却喜家书寄八行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07870.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07870","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}